Weakest is now the explanation. `components/debugger.nim:519` hard-codes "this route ships no client script" into a `title`: invisible in a still, on touch, and to anyone not hovering, in a pane with ~760px of unused space where the page already speaks in visible sentences. It is also unconditional, while `flake.nix:165` builds the deployable site with `-d:hydrationBundle=/assets/hydrate.js`. On the build users get, the button's only explanation names a cause that is false.

